{'symbol': 'AXON', 'date': '2021-07-13 07:30:00', 'title': 'ITALY TO DEPLOY AXON TASER DEVICES FOR THE FIRST TIME TO OFFICERS NATIONWIDE', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ., JULY 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AXON (NASDAQ: AXON), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN CONNECTED PUBLIC SAFETY TECHNOLOGIES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED THE NATIONAL TENDER TO SUPPLY TASER CONDUCTIVE ELECTRICAL DEVICES (CEDS) TO LAW ENFORCEMENT AGENCIES ACROSS ITALY.'}